      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764032040690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow: \n- Take seed URL from frontier and request IP from DNS\n- Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n- Extract text data from the HTML.\n- Store the text data in a database.\n- Extract any linked URLs from the web pages and add them to the list of URLs to crawl.\n- Repeat steps 1-5 until all URLs have been crawled.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow: \n- Take seed URL from frontier and request IP from DNS\n- Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n- Extract text data from the HTML.\n- Store the text data in a database.\n- Extract any linked URLs from the web pages and add them to the list of URLs to crawl.\n- Repeat steps 1-5 until all URLs have been crawled.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
